# Platform base URL encoded into an issue screen's wallet QR (QR v1 contract,
# spec FS-1.2.1 D8). Defaults to window.location.origin when unset.
#
# A physical wallet device on your LAN cannot reach "localhost" — it resolves to
# the phone itself, not your dev machine. Set this to your machine's LAN IP
# (e.g. http://192.168.1.42:5173) when testing QR redemption from a real device.
# VITE_QR_API_BASE=http://192.168.1.42:5173
